    - target: {fileID: 4711005256018735203, guid: 0daf8292e6fd6cf46a68c89d3a946ace, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Parkour quarrel is a (up to) 5 player local (online in work) Multiplayer
        Game, made in private.


        GamePlay:

        Players race across a
        map, Featuring obstacles. Points are awarded upon reaching the goal. After
        all players finish, they get to place obstacles into the world. First to
        cross a point threshold wins!


        What i did:

        Code(All)

        Shader(All)

        3D
        Art(All)

        UI(All)


        Made with:

        c#, Unity'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
